Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:14.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照這樣下去 我贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 準備做下一組動作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是幹什...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼呢 距離全國錦標賽就剩一周了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精力訓練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大家各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:01:01.93,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}結束漫不經心度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:06.10,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}滿心想要脫離現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:11.73,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我總是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:15.90,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牽著我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:21.74,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}帶我去看新的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界變幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.21,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邁出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:29.42,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛帶來了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:35.34,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再擔心 我們在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.88,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.47,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:41.68,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}雖然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:48.35,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不試試沒法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.85,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:54.86,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能觸碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.99,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我們不再孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:03.16,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:01:01.93,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:06.10,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:11.73,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:15.90,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:21.74,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.21,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:29.42,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:35.34,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:36.88,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.47,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:41.68,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:48.35,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.85,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:54.86,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.99,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:03.16,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻笑什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看誰發的消息呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻發的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的昵稱也叫saku啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.68,0:02:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始尖子的翻轉太不整齊太難看了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舞蹈動作拖泥帶水
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結尾處 所有人的表情和死了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,櫻是我高中時代的隊友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我常把我們的訓練視頻發給她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請她提一些意見
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抖M嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受虐狂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真為翔感到高興
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 他終於解開了心結
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說了沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:03:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 回家路上去醫院 我陪你去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓巳 身體不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 剛才好像咳嗽來著
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實沒什麼事 哥哥他...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這小子從小身體弱 我不放心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小題大做 今天我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人只有獨立了才算得上是男人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該獨立的人 是我才對
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小學初中高中乃至大學我倆都是一起上的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但將來就不可能了 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分別又很寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我放棄柔道的時候 難不成...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐也覺得很寂寞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是阿晴的姐姐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是她 真努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 陪她一塊兒跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他還得去打工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去跟老闆說一聲阿晴晚點到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 我想說 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:44.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你聽說了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直輸的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你要參加全國啦啦隊錦標賽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得加油比賽 不用管我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼一直在擦這個杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有煩惱 可以和我聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我不確定自己能不能像你和阿一那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給出適當的建議
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你可以和我聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去掃廁所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 祝賀我們都通過了預賽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又撞了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡的巧克力蛋糕果然好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你也這樣覺得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教我做法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,店長出去了 等他回來我幫你問
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你回頭能給我發消息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 給你添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就是情人節了 我想加把勁做做看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.93,0:06:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是成功了帶給你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我算是明白了你集中不了精神的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別像預賽時那樣失誤不斷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那個 不是因為這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和哥哥吵架了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得自己該多練練
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 DOWN UP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多用用全身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝教練
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久別太心急
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多做想像訓練 想像自已順利完成的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天不訓練 但大家記得自己練
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解散
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝教練
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 我得去打工 先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天來我家練習嗎 金和尚史也來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1 2 DOWN UP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以啊佐久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的轉身
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我跟大家一起做動作的時候總做不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起啊 我這麼軟弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從小就愛哭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都說我的姐姐們比我更像男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有姐姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有姐姐真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的姐姐們可不像鍋島哥那麼貼心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥對我擔心過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找工作也不輕鬆 我希望他能多關心一下自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否則老被哥哥這麼擔心著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都快討厭自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 家家有本難念的經啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴也有姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倆以前一起練柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可姐姐一直都比我厲害得多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家也是 哥哥比我強太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家也...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有點慶倖今天來訓練了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本是因為怕在家裡見到哥哥會尷尬才出的門
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但就像阿晴說的一想到家家都有本難念的經
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心裡就輕鬆了些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是三個小老弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我該回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然很想向哥哥道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前不該對他說「不要擔心我」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久也回家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 如果可以的話能幫我個忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情人節... 不是女生做巧克力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用糾結這種小事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之所以會想要加入啦啦隊 全都是因為阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想謝謝他 於是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一喜歡什麼樣的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他應該喜歡加了杏仁的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎 那就把這個裹上巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做個四周灑滿可哥粉的杏仁巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 你在做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好濃的巧克力味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是啦啦隊的佐久間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是晴子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打擾你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這陣子你到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什麼 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於知道自己想說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然很想向哥哥道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想向你道歉 不該瞞著你放棄柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 我不是因為受傷才放棄的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想了很久自己是不是應該繼續練柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煩惱了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那個時候起...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說姐姐被前輩打敗了 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羨慕晴希啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是男生該多好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想變得比所有人都強
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也曾想過 換作是我會不會執著到這個地步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望自己是女生 而姐姐是男生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我思考過無數次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漸漸的 我只有身高超過了姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可比賽成績卻完全不如姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是說 我讓你進退兩難？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.23,0:12:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我自己覺得...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望只因為家裡是開道場的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只因為崇拜姐姐 所以練柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想找到屬於我的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 晴希你...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走上了與我不同的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我所擁有的只有柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都聽見了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你姐姐肯定能理解你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說不一定是現在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久 這次轉身非常利索
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 佐久成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望在正式比賽也能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得能行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我決定讓自己這樣認為
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也按教練說的做了想像訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是做不做得到 是一定要做到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到能從身邊的夥伴口中聽到這麼精彩的發言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而非某個陌生人的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久間 我也好感動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久 夠男人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 不過是友情巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴希你很期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要手工巧克力蛋糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔、翔告訴你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今年可能沒收穫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 應該至少能拿到一個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情人節快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼送給阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一可能不記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園祭那次是你拉了我一把
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是、是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才看到了啦啦隊表演
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是現在 我才會站在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為表感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就不客氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太多了吃不完 不介意的話請收下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰要你剩下的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡巧克力 多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我連義理巧克力都沒收到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥送我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.28,0:15:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 只有卓巳送我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好空虛的禮物交換
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光梨送我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝我幫她買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.71,0:15:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有女朋友的傢伙真淡定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼遠野有女朋友 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒收到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過她說今年做巧克力蛋糕送我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巧克力蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說有一家店的巧克力蛋糕超好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去打聽了做法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在很流行這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浩司
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小千
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠的女朋友是DREAMS的女生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪對啦啦隊這麼熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴抱歉 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼道歉啊 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作啊 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我來晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 這是送給大家的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等啦 情人節特製心形豬排咖喱烏冬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃的時候得把心弄碎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心碎烏冬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千裕和阿遠一起把巧克為蛋糕送到了高田牧舍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔說等打完工就拿到這裡來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好哎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定很苦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還有我們呢 打起精神來 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若是能心動 哪怕只有一瞬間也叫人羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這句太直白了 是誰的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涉·溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算今後都說自己想說的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再借用他人的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以來 我對任何事都缺乏經驗 光說不練
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但參加了啦啦隊 和許多人有交流之後
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才弄清了許多一直以來沒弄懂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒看清的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以來為了贏 棒球也好其他運動也好 我參加了許多
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但像這樣大家齊心協力去做一件事 還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的確 通過啦啦隊我明白了太多事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 我明白了自己和別人不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會遇到很多麻煩又有趣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...覺得雖然認真做一件事很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也很快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也明白了 要是想讓別人露出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得讓自己先面帶笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都跨越了各自的坎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要跨越我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會找到好姑娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了介紹給我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠那小子要去約會了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真氣人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把心碎烏冬的照片發給他看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我不該瞎起哄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 明年的情人節我一定贏過你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道完歉順便提醒你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天有大學校際冬季賽 柔道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可明天還得訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為現場比賽加油助威 不也是啦啦隊的訓練嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天訓練我請假
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 你會贏的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 進攻進攻
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有好好加油
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的應援貌似奏了效
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟給她加油的是我們BREAKERS的王牌尖子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遲到的情人節禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子 多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 你這是大拍賣的巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能收到親人巧克力的人沒資格抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年我還收到了教練巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這有什麼可驕傲的 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 好久沒練了 來練練柔道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是晴子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.15,0:22:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.03,0:22:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全國錦標賽 我也會去看的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:22.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}有苦有甜的情人節
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:25.80,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:27.42,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:30.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:35.85,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大聲回應
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:39.44,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,嶄新大門打開的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:42.52,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像緊緊握住的拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:45.86,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,決意堅定地響起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散發的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.66,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話感覺能改變些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是在尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:59.00,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.71,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自棄＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.59,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要輸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上應援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:13.80,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打氣的動作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.93,0:23:17.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:20.77,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂頭喪氣抱怨「到極限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.11,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破極限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:27.44,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS ＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:30.61,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.95,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利的姿勢＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:37.08,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,連同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:40.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著邂逅閃耀笑容的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:48.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:35.85,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:39.44,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:42.52,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:45.86,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:49.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.66,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:59.00,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.46,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.71,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:07.59,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.67,0:23:09.17,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:13.80,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.93,0:23:17.18,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.31,0:23:20.77,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.11,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:27.44,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:30.61,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.95,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:37.08,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:40.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.97,0:23:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B R E A K E R S
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.68,0:24:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET‘S GO 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FOR LOVE & PEACE
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS

